{"id":"661405","name":"血肠","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661405/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"血肠","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"1头"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"血肠一斤。","img":"images/661405/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"半锅水烧开。","img":"images/661405/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"血肠用水洗一下。","img":"images/661405/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放到开水锅里。","img":"images/661405/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖盖焖五分钟。","img":"images/661405/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"定时五分钟。","img":"images/661405/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备蒜泥，几粒蒜洗干净。","img":"images/661405/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用夹子压成蒜泥。","img":"images/661405/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上味极鲜。","img":"images/661405/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"烫完的血肠，捞出，放凉水中浸泡一分钟。","img":"images/661405/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"刀磨快，肠衣才好切断。","img":"images/661405/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"上下锯着切，才好切，切好摆盘。","img":"images/661405/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"点缀点香菜。","img":"images/661405/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"粘上蒜酱，开吃吧。","img":"images/661405/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}